    "steam_appid": 3083190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Survivor\u00a0is a bullet hell, a horde survivor, an action roguelite in which in addition to surviving and getting improvements you will have to meet the objectives of each mission to advance in this dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/4ca4349a792652cef91cda914651bd1f.poster.avif?t=1752526264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/4ca4349a792652cef91cda914651bd1f.webm?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/4ca4349a792652cef91cda914651bd1f.mp4?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accomplish objectives while surviving waves of enemies who will try to mentally short-circuit you to unlock new locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/1513ff0940e797fc881fc753d4709fc0.poster.avif?t=1752526264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/1513ff0940e797fc881fc753d4709fc0.webm?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/1513ff0940e797fc881fc753d4709fc0.mp4?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game in its original design will include 3 game modes: Campaign (or History), Survive and Extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/629d26fc8e43ffc0d9d09673467dac6a.avif?t=1752526264\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include a lot of different maps: futuristic levels, contemporary environments, fantasy locations and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the reason for this difference in environments? Time travel? Parallel worlds? Did the developer smoke a huge Kojima? Maybe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/263f8039cca2e38f589d72d6fc002cd7.avif?t=1752526264\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of characters with different abilities to fight the bad guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has one or more types of damage that they inflict on enemies and unique attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill more enemies, gain more experience and collect more molecules to become stronger (by buying more things).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/d27f9b5c397a35c3ed2f787a4102df9f.poster.avif?t=1752526264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/d27f9b5c397a35c3ed2f787a4102df9f.webm?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/d27f9b5c397a35c3ed2f787a4102df9f.mp4?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has 6 different weapons that can be acquired (pistols, rifles, katanas, knives, shotguns, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of character/weapon/skill combinations of your choice so you can blame the game when you die.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVEMENTS AND ACCESIBILITY</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improvements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/697a642bdf05beeb5381482288933b2b.poster.avif?t=1752526264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/697a642bdf05beeb5381482288933b2b.webm?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/697a642bdf05beeb5381482288933b2b.mp4?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summons (Melee, Ranged, Healthy, etc)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area Explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ShockWaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbital</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross (front and diagonal)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Front</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Etc.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accesibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable difficulty using the accessibility system so that you enjoy, or get frustrated, you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/05fe5460686147f3937dd7a8d407c667.poster.avif?t=1752526264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/05fe5460686147f3937dd7a8d407c667.webm?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/05fe5460686147f3937dd7a8d407c667.mp4?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick games (no more than 20 minutes if you play with both hands).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multitude of characters with different abilities to fight the bad guys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of character/weapon/skill combinations of your choice so you can blame the game when you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accomplish objectives while surviving waves of enemies who will try to mentally short-circuit you to unlock new locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill more enemies, gain more experience and collect more molecules to become stronger (by buying more things).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/60fa6de4cf4b2968b1f0d43a4534a1a2.poster.avif?t=1752526264\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/60fa6de4cf4b2968b1f0d43a4534a1a2.webm?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083190/extras/60fa6de4cf4b2968b1f0d43a4534a1a2.mp4?t=1752526264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
